Thanks again for your help.{VAR BE01}
My bug Pokémon are scurrying with
excitement about getting to battle you.{VAR BE01}
Let's get straight to it!{VAR BE01}

Aww...
I lost.{VAR BE01}
Whatever! Losing to you doesn't bug me
because you are a-MAZ-ingly strong!{VAR BE01}
This is the Gym Badge!
You beat me, so it's yours!{VAR BE01}

It's the Insect Badge!
It's insectible--I mean, incredible!{VAR BE01}
If you have three Badges,
Pokémon up to Lv. 40 will obey you,{VAR BE00}
including traded Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
Because I'm a generous guy,
I'll also give you this.{VAR BE01}

How many discoveries have you made
since you started your adventure?{VAR BE01}
When I was a kid, my innocent heart was
captured by the beauty of bug Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
I drew with them and battled with them,
and after all this time, I continue{VAR BE00}
to discover new things.{VAR BE01}
A world shared with Pokémon is a world
swarming with mysteries.

Burgh: Heya!
This is what I do.{VAR BE01}
I keep raising Pokémon and drawing
pictures inspired by the Pokémon I raise.{VAR BE01}
It's what I love to do. My life hums
with energy. What could be better?

When you step on the switch,
the one that pops out is--moi!{VAR BE01}
On that note, have a battle with moi!{VAR BE01}

Now. Come. On.{VAR BE01}
Step on this switch, and what happens?
Moi!

Yeeeeeeeeah! Thank you for going
to the trouble of calling me out!{VAR BE01}
I'll channel my gratitude into my
Pokémon's moves and...{VAR BE00}
make sure it gets to you!{VAR BE01}

What do you think of Castelia City?{VAR BE01}
I bet, with all of the bustling people,
you started feeling worn down on your{VAR BE00}
way to the Gym!{VAR BE01}
Never mind! This will help. Take it!{VAR BE01}

The theme of this Gym is
walking through walls.{VAR BE01}
At first glance, these funny honey walls
may look impassable or even impossible.{VAR BE00}
If you try hard, it'll work out. So I say.{VAR BE01}
But...if it doesn't, here's a sweet tip:
step on the switches on the floor!

Wow! That's amazing!{VAR BE01}
You swatted aside our Gym Leader
Burgh's tricky attacks...{VAR BE01}
I can barely imagine how much
stronger you're going to get!

The Gym Leader said he was going to
Prime Pier and left for a little bit.{VAR BE01}
You're welcome to go track him down.

